  "prefLabel": "Odb 402.09 Corrective action contractor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.09 “Corrective action contractor” means an individual or company that is primarily in the business of providing corrective action services, has the necessary equipment and facilities, and employs appropriately-trained, experienced personnel with current U.S. Occupational Safety and Health Administration certification.\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
